desc":"財務槓桿未惡化 (ΔLeverage ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"總負債資產比率 = 29.2%"},{"id":6,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"短期流動性安全 (ΔLiquidity > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"流動比率 = 1.77"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":5.06,"default_fair_val":5.06,"premium_pct":-2,"is_undervalued":true,"pe_trailing":5.5,"pe_forward":4.8,"pb_trailing":1.5,"pb_forward":1.4,"div_yield":1.58,"ps_ratio":3.4,"fcf_to_ev":7.18,"fcf_to_mcap":7.45,"liab_to_assets":29.2,"cash_to_assets":4.8,"current_ratio":1.77,"roe":27.1,"roa":19,"moat":{"ticker":"BTG","period":"2026Q3","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"黃金產業的本質是商品，品牌溢價空間有限。B2Gold 作為一家大型黃金生產商，其品牌價值主要體現在運營效率和可靠性上，而非產品本身的差異化。雖然公司在特定市場或投資者心中有一定聲譽，但面對全球黃金市場的價格波動，其定價權受到極大限制。與奢侈品或科技公司不同，黃金的購買決策更多基於現貨價格和對未來金價的預期，而非品牌忠誠度。因此，在品牌定價權方面，B2Gold 處於中等水平，壁壘相對較弱。","comment_en":"The nature of the gold industry is commodity-based, limiting the scope for brand premium. B2Gold, as a large gold producer, derives its brand value primarily from operational efficiency and reliability rather than product differentiation. While the company holds a certain reputation in specific markets or among investors, its pricing power is severely constrained by global gold price fluctuations. Unlike luxury goods or tech companies, gold purchasing decisions are driven more by spot prices and expectations of future gold prices than brand loyalty. Therefore, B2Gold's brand pricing power is at a moderate level, with relatively weak barriers."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":3,"comment_zh":"黃金開採行業的壁壘主要來自於礦權、勘探技術和環保法規，而非專利。B2Gold 的核心競爭力在於其礦產資源的獲取、開發和運營能力。雖然公司可能擁有某些採礦技術或流程的專利，但這些通常難以構成持久的、絕對的競爭優勢。行業的監管環境（如環保、勞工安全）是重要的考量，但這更多是運營成本和風險，而非能築起高牆的專利壁壘。因此，在專利和監管壁壘方面，B2Gold 的得分較低。","comment_en":"Barriers in the gold mining industry stem primarily from mining rights, exploration technology, and environmental regulations, rather than patents. B2Gold's core competency lies in its ability to acquire, develop, and operate mineral resources. While the company may hold patents for certain mining techniques or processes, these typically do not constitute a lasting, absolute competitive advantage. The industry's regulatory environment (e.g., environmental protection, labor safety) is a significant consideration, but this represents operational costs and risks rather than a strong patent barrier. Consequently, B2Gold scores low on patent and regulatory barriers."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":4,"comment_zh":"對於黃金生產商而言，客戶（主要是金商、央行或工業用戶）轉換供應商的成本相對較低。一旦礦山生產出黃金，其出售對象的選擇相對靈活，主要取決於價格和交易便利性。B2Gold 的客戶不太可能因為轉換成本而產生高度忠誠度。公司需要持續提供有競爭力的價格和穩定的供應來維持客戶關係。因此，轉換成本並非 B2Gold 的主要護城河，其得分為中等偏弱。","comment_en":"For gold producers, the cost for customers (primarily bullion dealers, central banks, or industrial users) to switch suppliers is relatively low. Once a mine produces gold, the choice of buyer is flexible, largely depending on price and transaction convenience. B2Gold's customers are unlikely to exhibit high loyalty due to switching costs. The company must consistently offer competitive prices and stable supply to maintain customer relationships. Therefore, switching costs are not a primary moat for B2Gold, resulting in a below-average score."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"黃金開採行業幾乎不存在網絡效應。B2Gold 的業務模式不依賴於用戶數量的增加來提升產品或服務的價值。其價值主要來自於礦產資源的儲量、開採效率和金價。與社交媒體、電商平台等依賴網絡效應的業務截然不同，B2Gold 的競爭優勢不來自於網絡效應。因此，在此維度上，其得分極低。","comment_en":"Network effects are virtually non-existent in the gold mining industry. B2Gold's business model does not rely on an increasing number of users to enhance the value of its products or services. Its value primarily derives from mineral reserves, mining efficiency, and gold prices. Unlike businesses dependent on network effects such as social media or e-commerce platforms, B2Gold's competitive advantage does not stem from network effects. Therefore, its score in this dimension is very low."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"B2Gold 作為一家大型黃金生產商，在規模經濟方面具有一定的優勢。大型礦企通常能透過規模化採購、更高效的設備利用率、集中的管理和研發投入，降低單位生產成本。其在勘探、開發新礦區以及應對複雜地質條件時，也能獲得規模帶來的經驗和技術積累。然而，黃金價格的波動性會影響其成本優勢的體現。相較於小型礦企，B2Gold 的規模帶來了更穩健的成本控制能力，屬於堅固的壁壘。","comment_en":"As a large gold producer, B2Gold possesses certain advantages in economies of scale. Major mining companies can typically reduce unit production costs through bulk purchasing, more efficient equipment utilization, and centralized management and R&D investments. They also gain experience and technological accumulation from scale when exploring and developing new mining areas or dealing with complex geological conditions. However, the volatility of gold prices can affect the manifestation of its cost advantage. Compared to smaller mining companies, B2Gold's scale provides more robust cost control capabilities, representing a solid barrier."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"B2Gold 在全球範圍內擁有並運營多個礦場，其中一些位於政治相對穩定且礦產資源豐富的地區，例如加拿大、馬利和菲律賓。這些特定地理位置的優質礦產資源，尤其是高品位礦脈，構成了其獨特的資產壁壘。獲取和開發新的優質礦區成本高昂且充滿不確定性，B2Gold 已有的礦產儲備和地理位置優勢，使其在行業內處於有利地位。這種對特定優質礦產資源的控制，是其堅固的護城河。","comment_en":"B2Gold owns and operates multiple mines globally, some located in relatively politically stable regions rich in mineral resources, such as Canada, Mali, and the Philippines. These high-quality mineral resources in specific geographic locations, especially high-grade veins, constitute its unique asset barrier. Acquiring and developing new high-quality mining areas is costly and uncertain. B2Gold's existing mineral reserves and geographic advantages place it in a favorable position within the industry. This control over specific, high-quality mineral resources is its solid moat."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"B2Gold 在運營效率方面表現出色，體現在其持續優化採礦技術、提高生產率和嚴格控制成本的能力上。公司過往的業績顯示其能夠在複雜的運營環境中穩定產出，並有效管理生產過程。這種卓越的運營能力，使其能夠在行業平均水平之上獲得更高的利潤率和自由現金流。在黃金這個對成本控制極為敏感的行業，持續的運營效率是構成堅固護城河的重要因素。","comment_en":"B2Gold demonstrates excellent operational efficiency, reflected in its ability to continuously optimize mining techniques, enhance productivity, and strictly control costs. The company's past performance indicates its capacity for stable output even in complex operating environments and effective management of production processes. This operational excellence allows it to achieve higher profit margins and free cash flow above the industry average. In the gold industry, where cost control is paramount, sustained operational efficiency is a crucial component of a strong moat."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"B2Gold 在資本配置方面展現出相對穩健的策略。公司在擴大生產、開發新項目、債務管理以及股息支付之間取得平衡。其過往的自由現金流產生能力，以及對股東回報的承諾，顯示出管理層在資本配置上的審慎態度。雖然黃金行業的資本密集性要求持續投入，但 B2Gold 能夠在維持穩健資產負債表和為股東創造價值之間取得平衡，這構成了一個堅固的護城河。","comment_en":"B2Gold exhibits a relatively sound strategy in capital allocation. The company balances expansion of production, development of new projects, debt management, and dividend payments. Its historical ability to generate free cash flow and commitment to shareholder returns indicate a prudent approach to capital allocation by management. Although the capital-intensive nature of the gold industry requires continuous investment, B2Gold's ability to balance maintaining a solid balance sheet with creating shareholder value constitutes a solid moat."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":4,"comment_zh":"如 M3 所述，黃金生產商的客戶關係更多基於交易而非深度綁定。B2Gold 的客戶（主要是金商和工業用戶）在選擇供應商時，價格和供應穩定性是關鍵考量因素。雖然公司努力建立良好的合作關係，但客戶轉換的機會成本不高。因此，客戶忠誠度和留存率並非 B2Gold 的核心競爭優勢，其在此維度的得分為中等偏弱。","comment_en":"As mentioned in M3, customer relationships for gold producers are more transactional than deeply binding. For B2Gold's customers (primarily bullion dealers and industrial users), price and supply stability are key considerations when choosing a supplier. While the company strives to build good working relationships, the opportunity cost of switching suppliers is not high. Therefore, customer loyalty and retention are not core competitive advantages for B2Gold, resulting in a below-average score in this dimension."},"m10_durability":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"B2Gold 的業務具有一定的持久性，主要得益於其擁有的礦產資源儲備。黃金作為一種稀缺貴金屬，其長期需求相對穩定。只要公司能夠持續發現和開發新的礦藏，並有效管理運營成本，其業務就能維持較長時間。然而，礦產資源的枯竭是行業固有的挑戰，金價的劇烈波動也可能影響其長期盈利能力。總體而言，憑藉其資源儲備和運營能力，B2Gold 的業務護城河具有較好的持久性，屬於堅固級別。","comment_en":"B2Gold's business possesses a degree of durability, primarily due to its mineral resource reserves. Gold, as a scarce precious metal, has relatively stable long-term demand. As long as the company can continuously discover and develop new deposits and effectively manage operating costs, its business can be sustained for a considerable period. However, the depletion of mineral resources is an inherent challenge in the industry, and significant fluctuations in gold prices can also impact its long-term profitability. Overall, with its resource reserves and operational capabilities, B2Gold's business moat exhibits good durability, qualifying as solid."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"B2Gold 的經濟護城河主要體現在其對特定優質礦產資源（M6）的控制、規模帶來的成本優勢（M5）以及卓越的運營效率（M7）。這些因素共同構成了其相對堅固的競爭壁壘。然而，黃金行業的商品屬性限制了品牌定價權（M1），而網絡效應（M4）和轉換成本（M3）幾乎不存在。其護城河更偏向於資源型和運營型，而非特許經營或收費橋模式。管理層的資本配置（M8）和業務持久性（M10）亦提供一定支撐，但需警惕礦產枯竭風險。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"B2Gold's economic moat is primarily reflected in its control over specific high-quality mineral resources (M6), cost advantages derived from scale (M5), and excellent operational efficiency (M7). These factors collectively form its relatively solid competitive barriers. However, the commodity nature of the gold industry limits brand pricing power (M1), while network effects (M4) and switching costs (M3) are virtually non-existent. Its moat leans more towards resource-based and operational strengths rather than franchise or toll-bridge models. Management's capital allocation (M8) and business durability (M10) also provide support, though risks of resource depletion must be monitored.","evidenceHash":"11176b55408c34ea2265800d012dfc537f4662cf0e9158e59d1c28f3b51cebf2","assessmentPolicy":"buffett-moat-v3","model":"gemini-2.5-flash-lite","provider":"Gemini"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null,"evidenceHash":"11176b55408c34ea2265800d012dfc537f4662cf0e9158e59d1c28f3b51cebf2","currentEvidenceHash":"11176b55408c34ea2265800d012dfc537f4662cf0e9158e59d1c28f3b51cebf2"},"fScore":{"score":8,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"grey","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-11-13T07:46:41.727Z","evidenceHash":"8b5b378f3f9f0bc3c671da3c628c68c3331170a16e954f65ebc17d3ce50dd410"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-11-13T07:46:41.727Z","evidenceHash":"8b5b378f3f9f0bc3c671da3c628c68c3331170a16e954f65ebc17d3ce50dd410"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/BTG.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/BTG.png","website":"https://www.b2gold.com","ceo":"Michael Andrew Cinnamond","full_time_employees":"6327","description":"B2Gold Corp. operates as a prominent gold mining enterprise, currently running three active production sites across different continents. Its primary operational mines include the Fekola Mine in Mali, the Masbate Mine situated in the Philippines, and the Otjikoto Mine located in Namibia. In addition to its wholly-owned assets, the company holds a 25% ownership stake in Calibre Mining Corp. and an approximate 19% interest in BeMetals Corp. Furthermore, B2Gold manages a diverse collection of evaluation and exploration assets spread across Mali, Uzbekistan, and Finland. The company, which was founded in 2006, bases its corporate headquarters in Vancouver, Canada.","description_en":"B2Gold Corp. operates as a 